# P1 moved while notes are held: a held note keeps its patch (no jump, no click), the next note plays the new one.
# A chord on "warm pad", P1 swept across the whole bank under it, then new notes pick up whatever P1 has reached.
tempo 100
steps 24
tail 2.5
track chord
preset 148 128 0 0 255 110 0 0 128 0 128 150 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C3 12 100
note 0 G3 12 100
note 0 E4 12 100
sweep p1 148 0 2 6
sweep p1 0 255 6 10
param p1 4 10
note 12 D3 2 100
note 14 A3 2 100
param p1 172 16
note 16 F3 4 100
note 16 C4 4 100
expect sound 0 20
expect idle 36
expect peak_below 0
